*Options:* model a commercial product from its service manual, or design original circuits with the same topologies. *Choice:* original circuits (@tab:library): no copied service documents, full ground truth, standard preamplifier and line-level topologies. *Consequence:* transfer must be shown, first on low-voltage boards of the line driver (T7), then on one transcribed product.
